{"reviews":[{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-0","r":1.0,"t":"Pass","x":"I don\u2019t know what product everyone else is reviewing, but these buffers are bottom of the barrel. They literally do nothing.  Weird grit level and oddly soft.  Wholly ineffective.  Maybe I got a bad batch, but man oh man I wholeheartedly do not recommend.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great value!","x":"It is a great kit for nails! Practical and beautiful. Enough for you to share with your friends! Great Value!","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-2","r":1.0,"t":"What did I buy?","x":"I'm not even sure what I purchased. The nail files are ok, and all the same grit (wish they varied), but the colorful blocks are what stumped me. These are NOT buffers. They are blocks with extremely randomly grit and uneven bumps, and did absolutely nothing.  Very disappointed.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-3","r":4.0,"t":"Perfect for Acrylics and not natural nails, no variety","x":"I wish I had known the grit for the files would be all the same. I wouldn\u2019t recommend these for your natural nails, because they will file the whole thing off and away. Some grit residue upon opening but nothing to be upset over, just tap it away. These work amazing for acrylic tips and nails and make shaping them easy.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-4","r":1.0,"t":"Terrible.  Just...Terrible.","x":"So don\u2019t...  Product.  The price was good and had great reviews which is why I ordered 3...units.  I had them for about a month before using them.  This weekend\u2014I \u2018happily\u2019 brought them out to use and \u2018angrily\u2019\u2014threw the buffer blocks...in tha\u2019 trash.  Quick.  These are HORRIBLE!!!!  I don\u2019t know how these little \u2018monsters\u2019 garnered almost 5 stars????  They DO NOT have the much needed \u2018grit\u2019 and if they did\u2014it \u2018melted\u2019 (I\u2019m thinking during \u2018heating\u2019) to a slightly \u2018textured\u2019 yet EXTREMELY \u2018slick","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-5","r":1.0,"t":"Scouring not buffing","x":"These are not buffers. They will just scratch your nails.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great deal, super fast shipping!","x":"Super fast shipping and great quality products!! I bought this for my bridal party so we could have a girls night and do our nails. Perfect sets to enjoy together, the vibrant colors are fantastic, and they were each so excited to keep their set!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-7","r":5.0,"t":"Worth it for your money","x":"This product is worth it for the money. I am a beginner for doing gel nails and this kit has helped a lot. I definitely recommend this for other buyers, especially beginners.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-8","r":5.0,"t":"These are great","x":"I can do my own manicures and these work very well for me. Also the step by step instructions they send you are amazing.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-9","r":4.0,"t":"Good price","x":"The buffers are 5 stars but the nail file aren\u2019t my favorite. Because of the quantity is a good deal","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-10","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality","x":"I like this they are good and sturdy they diles and the buffers works good with acrylic nails. !","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-11","r":5.0,"t":"Cute","x":"I like the quality! Not only did I receive a decent amount, but they were also sturdy!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-12","r":5.0,"t":"good enough","x":"the files are good the blocks aren\u2019t as good!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-13","r":3.0,"t":"The files are great but the buffers...","x":"The files are great because they actually work but the buffers do not work at all. I got this just for the buffers because I never had one and wanted to try them out. The blocks seems like they are just blocks of foam and they have this hard coating on to seem that it has grit but when you try it on your nails it doesn't even work at all. I thought that it was just for one block but nope it's all of the blocks. It also has this weird smell and when I tested them out, I guess some of their coatin","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-14","r":3.0,"t":"Files are great the buffers not so much","x":"They files are great. They do just what files should do. They file!! The buffers are just more of the same. I wouldn't even say they are buffers as they don't buff. They are just a lower grade of sandpaper. If you need files then this is your go to but you could probably save money just buying nail files rather than this set.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-15","r":1.0,"t":"Files only, NO buffers","x":"Just 2 kinds of files, both too course to be used for buffing. Fine if all you want to do is file, but I was specifically looking to be able to smooth buff my nails too. Wasted money, misleading label.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-16","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth the cheap price - doesn't work","x":"For the price you pay, it's no surprise the quality is so low. The buffing sand is so slippery, it's hard to get a good smooth finish. If you want products that actually work, spend extra to get it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-17","r":1.0,"t":"Not a good product","x":"When filing it leaves black grains all over the nail. Tried using a another one, same thing happens. I had to use a tooth pick to remove left over grits under and along side of my nail","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-18","r":3.0,"t":"Buffers aren\u2019t worth the money...","x":"Great files, crap buffers. The buffers have some sort of weird coating on the outside. I bought these to use on acrylic nails, but I don\u2019t think they would even buff a natural nail.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-19","r":5.0,"t":"Great set","x":"I would like it more if the Emory boards had different types. I haven\u2019t noticed any differences between boards. They all are very course. The buffers are my favorite","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great Price and quality items!!!","x":"Love this kit. I do my own nails so I can go through nail files and buffers pretty fast. You get everything as it is shown in the pic and shipping was fast as well!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-21","r":5.0,"t":"You got to grab these!","x":"I'm a self taught nail tech b.k.a a beginner and these are by far the best filers and buffers I ever had my hands on. They get the work done! Very impressed!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality and value!!","x":"Great Price and great quality, I was pleasantly surprised when I opened and used the nail files and buffers!! will def buy again!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-23","r":4.0,"t":"JUST STARTED USING","x":"I have rather weak. damaged nails but these emery boards and especially the buffer appear to be helping. Let's wait and see.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07T8L1SX2-24","r":2.0,"t":"It\u2019s not even a buffer","x":"Nail file was ok.. but buffer was not even anywhere close to a buffer. It\u2019s so plastic like. Will not purchase again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the buffer blocks are ineffective and do not actually buff, with some describing them as scratchy or like sandpaper.","cites":[1,3,5,6,14,15]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the value and quantity, calling it a good deal with enough pieces to share.","cites":[2,7,8,10,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the nail files work well, though some wish the grit varied.","cites":[3,4,10,13,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the product works well for acrylic nails and beginners, with helpful instructions.","cites":[4,8,9,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the items are sturdy and of good quality.","cites":[11,12]}]},"qa":[]}